{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1792180319,"nonce":"CT4fWPeenbFW4Yj5ThsQQvk8pcg=","message":"Reference for the banner's car (given 2026-10-16): a large silver electric SUV seen from the front-left three-quarters at about eye height, in a white studio. The car is modelled to its form, without any maker's badge.\n\n**Proportions**\nAbout 5.0 m long, 1.96 m wide and 1.70 m tall, wheelbase about 3.1 m, wheels about 0.80 m across (21 to 22 inch rims with low tyres), about 0.20 m of ground clearance. Short overhangs; the front wheel sits right under the A-pillar's foot.\n\n**Silhouette**\nOne smooth bow from nose to tail. A short hood curving down into a rounded nose; a raked windshield (about 30 degrees); a long roof that stays high and falls only a little before a small spoiler; a steep rear window over an upright tailgate. The window line rises gently to the rear and kicks up at the quarter window behind the rear door.\n\n**Front**\nA wide gloss-black panel between the headlamps, from about 0.58 m to 0.84 m high, with a light strip along its top joining slim headlamps at the upper corners. Below it a body-coloured bumper with a thin chrome line, a wide black lower intake with horizontal slats, and black vertical intakes at the corners edged in chrome.\n\n**Side**\nVery clean, softly convex surfaces with only a faint shoulder; flush door handles just under the shoulder; black cladding round the wheel arches and along the sill, a chrome strip on the sill cladding; chrome trim round the side windows, a black B-pillar, three side windows (front door, rear door, quarter). Body-coloured mirrors on black arms at the front of the front doors.\n\n**Roof and glass**\nBody-coloured roof (no glass roof). Glass lightly tinted: the seats show through it.\n\n**Wheels**\nLarge multi-spoke rims, about ten slim spokes in pairs, silver faces with dark recesses; low-profile black tyres.\n\n**Paint and light**\nSilver metallic with soft, broad studio reflections; a white, evenly lit studio with a soft contact shadow.","files":null}]}